build` and `npm test` commands each exited `254` because this fixture has no `package.json`; neither command could start. The harness-map validator also exited `1` because its referenced `PRODUCT_SPEC.md` is absent. These unavailable checks are not reported as passes; the focused repository probe above is the successful runtime evidence.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
